// Wave 2 piece N: SelfDamage E2E demo. Caster takes 5 + 5%·MaxHp
// damage on cast (= 10 at MaxHp=100 in the duel_abilities fixture).
//
// Lowers to AbilityProgram {
//   gate: { cooldown_ticks: 50 },
//   effects: [EffectOp::SelfDamage { amount: 5.0 }],
//   scalings_per_effect: [[EffectScaling { stat_ref: MaxHp, percent: 0.05 }]],
// }
//
// `+ 5% max_hp` exercises Wave 1.5#4 scaling-modifier lowering — the
// fraction (0.05) lands in program.scalings_per_effect and the .sim
// verb hand-mirrors the scaled magnitude as `bleed_amount = 10` (the
// fixture pins MaxHp = 100 so the scaled total is constant).
// Registry-driven scaling dispatch (per-effect kernel reads
// program.scalings_per_effect and multiplies by the agent's stat) is
// later infrastructure; this verb hand-mirror is the binding analogue.

ability Bleed {
    target: self
    cooldown: 5s

    self_damage 5 + 5% max_hp
}
